Source: libsaigearbox
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Juniper Networks <sonic@juniper.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 9)
Standards-Version: 3.9.6

Package: libsaigearbox
Architecture: amd64
Description: Broadcom gearbox/PHY SAI library (EPDM + PAI + Agera + Barchetta)
 Shared library implementing SAI for Broadcom retimer/gearbox PHYs. Carries all
 PHY families (Agera AGR3 and Barchetta BARC) in one library, shared by both
 gbsyncd dockers.
